00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.780
want to know the source of our hope?

14
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.420
And what are some questions we can ask other people to help them along their

15
00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:30.760
spiritual journeys? A few years ago, I co-wrote a book called Is God Just a Human

16
00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:33.320
Invention with a friend of mine named Jonathan Morrow.

17
00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:38.880
The goal was to provide succinct and yet thoughtful answers to the 17 biggest

18
00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:42.300
questions skeptics and atheists were asking about God.

19
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:45.660
While Christians were reading it I was getting a good response but I started to

20
00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:50.500
think to myself how could I get other non-believers to read it and engage with the

21
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:55.480
ideas. So I called up one of the largest skeptic groups near where I live I told the

22
00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:59.500
head I said I'd be happy to come sit in the hot seat of your group and just answer

