00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.940
questions that you and some of the other skeptics in your group would have towards a

24
00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:08.060
Christian. I went up there and they had questions about the existence of God,

25
00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:12.740
questions about the Bible, political questions and even specific questions what I

26
00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:15.760
believed about the soul. It was a blast.

27
00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:21.360
Before the event began, I'd asked the leader if it was okay towards the end if I

28
