What bad impressions do Christians often leave?

34
00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:48.440
And how can Christians improve their interaction with skeptics?

35
00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:51.940
And I'll never forget a lady sitting right in the front to my right.

36
00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.280
She was maybe 70 years old. She said, listen.

37
00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:58.400
I said, tell me what you mean. She said, a lot of my Christian friends want to speak

38
00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.120
to me. Tell me why I'm wrong. Preach the gospel at me.

39
00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.140
Occasionally tell me I'm going to hell.

40
00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.460
But when I want to share my beliefs, they don't want to listen to me.

41
00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:12.460
why should I listen to them when they don't listen to me the fellow in the back

