00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.960
who's maybe 50 years old who described himself as a former Christian he said stop

43
00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:22.180
slandering atheists and I said well that's a pretty serious charge what do you mean

44
00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:27.320
he said look I'm an atheist but occasionally I'll just show up and I'll go to church

45
00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:32.700
people don't know who I am or why I'm there I just listen he said almost every time

