00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:38.620
I show up I hear some cheap shot often from the stage about atheists or some

47
00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.180
other non-Christian group.

48
00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:46.580
Here's the bottom line. If we don't treat non-believers the way that Christ calls us

49
00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:51.060
