50
00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:55.860
You see, the Bible tells us that Jesus came in grace and he came in truth.

51
00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:02.000
He came in grace which is in a loving relationship and he also spoke truth.

52
00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.340
We are called to speak truth.

53
00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:08.180
We can't compromise truth, but we must do it in love.

54
00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:14.420
If we mess up the relationship so often people won't even hear what we believe is

55
00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:19.460
true. If we want people to ask us questions about our faith, we need to be living

56
00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.980
the kind of lives that invite inquiry.

57
00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:27.260
We need to be living the kind of lives that makes people wonder what is the source

58
00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:32.300
of that person's hope? But we also need to be ready with some thoughtful questions

59
00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:36.760
we can ask other people to help them along on their spiritual journeys.

60
00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.760
Here's some specific questions that I found helpful in my own experience and

61
00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.280
